<manifest xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android">
    <!-- Personal, non-Play distribution flavor overlay. Merged over src/main +
         every plugin's library manifest for every build type of the `sideload`
         flavor (sideloadDebug, sideloadProfile, sideloadRelease). Contributes
         nothing, so READ_SMS from src/main and from flutter_sms_inbox's own
         library manifest survives the merge and the SMS Inbox feature works.

         Build with the "sideload" flavor (see RELEASE.md for the exact
         command; not written out here because a literal double-hyphen CLI
         flag inside an XML comment is invalid XML and fails the manifest
         merger).

         Never upload this flavor's output to Google Play. See
         PLAY_STORE.md, section "SMS Inbox and the Play build". -->
</manifest>
